## Install

```bash
python3 scripts/verify_wiki_workflow_kit.py --help
```

## Quick Start

### What This Is

This is a workflow knowledge-base template for:

- raw intake in [inbox/README.md](inbox/README.md)
- durable pages in [wiki/index.md](wiki/index.md)
- workflow-level change governance in [openspec/](openspec/)
- runtime entrypoints in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md)

### Suggested Order

```bash
sed -n '1,200p' PROJECT.md
sed -n '1,200p' wiki/index.md
sed -n '1,200p' inbox/README.md
python3 scripts/verify_wiki_workflow_kit.py
```

